            TEXT "Forbidden Virtues\n\nMAJOR, SOCIAL STATUS VIRTUE\n\nMagister in Artibus *(European-style*\n\n*universities do not exist in Muslim lands)*\n\nMINOR, SOCIAL STATUS VIRTUES\n\nClerk Mendicant Friar Priest"
        }
    }

